1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 1 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
Yesterday, Leo was
all alone…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,400
…and then you
showed up!

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Yesterday: 1 resident.

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,700
Today, we are 57!

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,800
That brings
€56,088 into the budget!

7
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:17,100
Ecaterina, ExtTalCat and Kalina
move in with Leo!

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,900
His house is full!

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,200
Joshua asked for
a separate house…

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,800
Here it is!

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,600
But 47 of you
still sleep in tents!

12
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:28,100
2 of you wanted
an apartment block…

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,900
Room for 120 more!

14
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,900
Yoan, Gabor and 45 more
move in!

15
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:35,500
Welcome Ambo, kratos, Minijr, James and Ray!

16
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,900
And what do you
want next?

17
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,300
School and police station
are tied!

18
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,800
The school costs
€120,000.

19
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,200
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

20
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,700
Who wants to be
the first principal?

21
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,100
Tell me in the
comments!
